was legal and aboveboard,

00:11:46.667 --> 00:11:47.734
then I'm sorry, you're a...

00:11:47.734 --> 00:11:50.801
-Excuse me. Sorry.
"Effing a-hole."

00:11:50.801 --> 00:11:52.300
[ Laughter ]

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:54.234
-This has been "A Closer Look."
